Z||000020||Raydar||11-08-2001||10:17 PM||||The aero package was the rounded "shovel" nose, side skirts, and rear fascia with the bottom extensions molded in. The wing was an option. Not required with the aero package. Nor was it only available with the aero package.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||1
