Z||000028||Kelvin Vivian||11-09-2001||01:53 AM||||Here's my aero-notchback:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.printroom.com/_vti_bin/ViewImage.dll?userid=no_18&album_id=36084&image_id=0&courtesy=1"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.printroom.com/_vti_bin/ViewImage.dll?userid=no_18&album_id=36084&image_id=1&courtesy=1"> <P>1987 Fiero SE 4-cylinder, 5-spd Isuzu tranny<BR>factory options: sunroof, spoiler, AC, performance sound, tilt, trunk release, manual mirrors, manual locks, manual windows, no rear defrost<BR>non-factory options: 86/7 GT rims, holley side scoop, GT leather shift knob, passenger sun visor has a vanity mirror (from an 87 GT), K&N air filter.<P>What I like about this car is that it has the looks of a V6 Fiero, but it has the 4-cyl Iron Duke motor.  This 4-cyl even has the twin pipe dual exhaust of the GTs. The rear decklid logo just says "Fiero" so you'd have to listen to it run, or drive it, to realize it's a 4-cyl.  It's basically a 1987 Indy Fiero.<P>KV<BR>87 SE 4-cyl, 5-spd<BR>88 GT T-Top, 5-spd||||reg||14
Z||000029||Sootah||11-09-2001||02:17 AM||||Sootah's 85 <B>GT</B>:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sootah__Black_Beauty_-_Drivers_Side.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sootah__Black_Beauty_-_Front_Right.jpg"> <P>Planned MODS: <BR><I>Un</I>throw the rod  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>Tint side windows 35%, Windshield 5%, Rear 35%<BR>Would lower it, but then I couldn't drive it, well, ANYWHERE around here.<BR>Clean up the interior a bit (Drivers seat rip that needs fixin')<P>Other than the fact that I can't drive it, she's a sweet ride.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><B>PEACE <I>-Sootah</B></I><P>BTW: Nice cars, everyone!<BR>              <P><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sootah__Nuclear_Happy_Face_Sig.jpg">     <BR><sup><I>Never pull your pants down in Cosco, the dang monkeys will getcha</I></sup> <BR><sup><B>AIM</B>: KSSouter</sup>||||reg||14
